<view class="home-page">
  <view class="home-card">
    <view class="home-kicker">TUOTUZJU MINI PROGRAM</view>
    <view class="home-title">拓途浙享</view>
    <view class="home-desc">
      校园项目、活动和资料的微信小程序入口。分享项目时会先进入原生项目名片，再前往详情或项目广场。
    </view>
    <view class="home-origin">{{webOrigin}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="home-actions">
    <button class="bridge-button primary" bindtap="openProjects">进入项目广场</button>
    <button class="bridge-button secondary" bindtap="openEvents">查看校园活动</button>
    <button class="bridge-button secondary" bindtap="openFallback">诊断入口</button>
  </view>
</view>
